# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Health data safety — read this before adding an exception below.
#
# Device probes and screenshots taken during development contain the
# maintainer's real glucose values. Those are special category health data
# under GDPR and must never enter version control, not even on a branch that
# is later deleted: git keeps the blob.
#
# Test fixtures must use invented values with the real *format*.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/probe/
/docs/probe/
shade*.xml
shade*.png
dumpsys*.txt
*.probe.xml
*.probe.png
*.dump.txt

